{"text": "On February 28, 1919. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A man came. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To Doctor Schofields house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Doctor Schofield. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I have a special favor to ask you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What can I do for you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Many people are going to gather tomorrow. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For the independence of Korea. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Could you take pictures of the event. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And share them with the world. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At 2 p, m, on March 1. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Doctor Schofield was hiding in a building. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And saw a large group of people. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Gathering outside. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He began to take pictures Unbelievable. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There are so many people here. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I hope. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The world will learn about this important event. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Through my pictures.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", " ", "F", "e", "b", "r", "u", "a", "r", "y", " ", "2", "8", ",", " ", "1", "9", "1", "9", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "o", " ", "D", "o", "c", "t", "o", "r", " ", "S", "c", "h", "o", "f", "i", "e", "l", "d", "s", " ", "h", "o", "u", "s", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "D", "o", "c", "t", "o", "r", " ", "S", "c", "h", "o", "f", "i", "e", "l", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", " ", "h", "a", "v", "e", " ", "a", " ", "s", "p", "e", "c", "i", "a", "l", " ", "f", "a", "v", "o", "r", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a